c50f5-273f-421e-bf70-61534da5cb9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92eb56e30e116a2029b3d08b2bac538c, https://si.imgix.net/878b2923/uploads/origins/1adc50f5-273f-421e-bf70-61534da5cb9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=604edb6e11512e2e5233facce59a0457 2x, https://si.imgix.net/878b2923/uploads/origins/1adc50f5-273f-421e-bf70-61534da5cb9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5de148a72bae7078142073cb28473534 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师您好，很高兴能继续与您合作，希望能够为oc进行配套的插画。\n服设细节您应该较为熟悉，基于现有细节即可。\n构图上希望能够采用自下而上的仰视视角，姿势上您可以自由发挥，简单的背景中包含月亮，雪和微风，人物的眼睛要带有与黑岩射手类似的荧光。\n参考图地址：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mix42CGR1g1igWzsouT6IobJLk7LRsHL?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kooriais/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/601dc9b5/uploads/origins/c03f197a-e74b-4d16-ae58-d7cc0ceadabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5a15d68b61b9cc87c50c73b2ec234c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/601dc9b5/uploads/origins/c03f197a-e74b-4d16-ae58-d7cc0ceadabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5a15d68b61b9cc87c50c73b2ec234c7, https://si.imgix.net/601dc9b5/uploads/origins/c03f197a-e74b-4d16-ae58-d7cc0ceadabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d2e47983001675b156de32d63b38d87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/601dc9b5/uploads/origins/c03f197a-e74b-4d16-ae58-d7cc0ceadabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e32651cf91671c8d06157a8e715210aa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到您。我喜欢你明亮可爱的插图，经常看它们。\n这次，我想请你为我的朋友画一幅插图作为礼物。\n我想让你为我的朋友画一个原创角色。人物的服装应该是白色连衣裙，背景应该是蓝天或草地，光线的方向应该是前方。构图由您决定。\n\n该人物的素材附在以下网址中： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vUOe4wGUsFFvX0Fiv8hnLfyQVktbRO2b?usp=drive_link\n\n该插图将作为我朋友的账户（@U0lY7）的图标，并用于在社交网站上发布。\n感谢您的考虑。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vUOe4wGUsFFvX0Fiv8hnLfyQVktbRO2b?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kooriais/works/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/53739cce/uploads/origins/7965ae4b-feb4-4132-8924-49b56f169c0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fd18ec4935de4044bef47c8ca5f563bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53739cce/uploads/origins/7965ae4b-feb4-4132-8924-49b56f169c0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fd18ec4935de4044bef47c8ca5f563bf, https://si.imgix.net/53739cce/uploads/origins/7965ae4b-feb4-4132-8924-49b56f169c0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=382de8911501ca8e84c19e21769b2495 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53739cce/uploads/origins/7965ae4b-feb4-4132-8924-49b56f169c0a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=60bbc2d825122a8e490f46a80b4ecc97 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kooriais/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f30ea7e/uploads/origins/1c85857e-803c-4fd8-b80c-46018714d291?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43cbf2eb6da59967051db9a51dd7108a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f30ea7e/uploads/origins/1c85857e-803c-4fd8-b80c-46018714d291?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43cbf2eb6da59967051db9a51dd7108a, https://si.imgix.net/3f30ea7e/uploads/origins/1c85857e-803c-4fd8-b80c-46018714d291?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&